{"lines": ["A lighthouse went dark in a storm, and its three keepers vanished.", "Flannan Isles, Scotland, December nineteen hundred. A passing ship saw no light.", "Eleven days passed before the relief boat got through the storms.", "When the relief keeper landed, the gate was shut, the beds were empty, the clock had stopped.", "Yet upstairs, the lamp was cleaned and ready.", "And Donald McArthur's coat still hung inside. He'd gone out in shirt sleeves, leaving the light alone, against the rules.", "The captain blamed a gale off the cliffs. But the west landing told another story.", "A rope box, a hundred and ten feet above the sea, was torn away, and iron railings were twisted.", "So the inspector decided one giant wave swept all three away.", "But no bodies were found, and nobody knows why one man left his coat.", "Which do you believe: one giant wave, or a gale off the cliffs?"], "words": [["A", 0.0, 0.06], ["lighthouse", 0.06, 0.38], ["went", 0.38, 0.76], ["dark", 0.76, 1.06], ["in", 1.06, 1.28], ["a", 1.28, 1.34], ["storm,", 1.34, 1.64], ["and", 2.08, 2.26], ["its", 2.26, 2.36], ["three", 2.36, 2.66], ["keepers", 2.66, 3.16], ["vanished.", 3.16, 3.5], ["Flannan", 4.228, 4.56], ["Isles,", 4.56, 4.82], ["Scotland,", 5.22, 5.6], ["December", 6.1, 6.32], ["nineteen", 6.32, 6.64], ["hundred.", 6.64, 6.92], ["A", 7.96, 8.06], ["passing", 8.06, 8.46], ["ship", 8.46, 8.76], ["saw", 8.76, 8.98], ["no", 8.98, 9.24], ["light.", 9.24, 9.46], ["Eleven", 10.0, 10.16], ["days", 10.16, 10.52], ["passed", 10.52, 10.96], ["before", 10.96, 11.64], ["the", 11.64, 11.86], ["relief", 11.86, 12.16], ["boat", 12.16, 12.42], ["got", 12.42, 12.74], ["through", 12.74, 13.06], ["the", 13.06, 13.22], ["storms.", 13.22, 13.46], ["When", 14.16, 14.2], ["the", 14.2, 14.3], ["relief", 14.3, 14.54], ["keeper", 14.54, 14.84], ["landed,", 14.84, 15.3], ["the", 15.74, 15.8], ["gate", 15.8, 16.0], ["was", 16.0, 16.26], ["shut,", 16.26, 16.58], ["the", 17.14, 17.2], ["beds", 17.2, 17.42], ["were", 